# .env.production
# nihongo.futari.live — production configuration.
#
# COMMITTED, but only ever in encrypted form. `dotenvx encrypt` replaces every
# value below with ciphertext and writes the private key to `.env.keys`, which
# is gitignored and lives only on the server. See DEPLOY.md step 4.
#
# Anything marked SHARED is dmb's — nihongo runs on the same host and reuses
# its Postgres, Redis, Brevo account and backup bucket. Changing it there means
# changing it here.

